WEBVTT

00:09:29.857 --> 00:09:31.066
As we look to the future,

00:09:31.108 --> 00:09:35.237
it's increasingly clear that it's going
to bring more and more volatility,

00:09:35.279 --> 00:09:37.364
as technology changes
more and more quickly.

00:09:38.115 --> 00:09:41.327
For creators, this means
new talent can succeed

00:09:41.327 --> 00:09:43.120
faster than ever before,

00:09:43.162 --> 00:09:44.955
and at an incredible scale.

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:48.584
It also means that we will never again see

00:09:48.626 --> 00:09:51.086
the stability in careers
that our grandparents saw.

00:09:54.089 --> 00:09:55.257
There's a problem.

00:09:56.675 --> 00:09:58.761
One challenge with this future

00:09:58.761 --> 00:10:01.388
is that our financial infrastructure,